## Security Design

### Security Layers

```
Request → CORS Filter → JWT Filter → Spring Security → Controller
              │              │               │
              │              │               └─ @PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')")
              │              └─ Extract userId from token
              └─ Allow only configured origins
```

### JWT Token Structure

```json
Header: { "alg": "HS512", "typ": "JWT" }
Payload: {
  "sub": "42",           // userId
  "email": "u@mail.com",
  "role": "USER",
  "iat": 1717843200,
  "exp": 1717929600      // 24 hours
}
Signature: HMACSHA512(base64(header) + "." + base64(payload), secret)
```

### Role Hierarchy

```
SUPER_ADMIN
    └── ADMIN
            └── USER
```

### Password Security
- BCrypt hashing (strength 10)
- Minimum 8 chars, uppercase + symbol required (frontend validation)
- Change password requires current password verification

